        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if that's the case, we can't let her hear this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "We mustn't burden her any further. She's already... carrying the weight of the world on her shoulders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We can't... let their efforts go to waste!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "They made the ultimate choice to let us live, so we have to return the favor... by making sure Amiya and the Doctor return safely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#2",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#2",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now isn't the time to be dejected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the Radiant Knight, shouldn't you always be our beacon of hope, no matter what happens?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#4",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "... I'm not sure anymore. But, I will do my part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regroup! Don't let your guard down! We're almost there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those who told me not to worry... None of them ended up coming back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
