    {
        "text": "Mm, I'm fine. I can walk on my own...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... lost consciousness for a little... but I'm okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We managed to make it out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Ace and the others...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
